---
// Corner dots + a dashed frame that draws itself around a button on hover/focus
// (after ThreeUI "Rectangle Buttons · Dot Border Button"). Place inside a .btn-dots element.
---

<span class="dot-frame" aria-hidden="true">
  <i class="df df-t"></i><i class="df df-r"></i><i class="df df-b"></i><i class="df df-l"></i>
  <b class="dd dd-tl"></b><b class="dd dd-tr"></b><b class="dd dd-br"></b><b class="dd dd-bl"></b>
</span>
